Changes made in this derivative include, but are not limited to:

  - Product identity, wordmark, icon set and colour system.
  - Telemetry: the upstream analytics key and host were removed. Reporting is
    off unless an operator sets OPENVZ_TELEMETRY_ENABLED, and it has no
    destination until OPENVZ_POSTHOG_KEY is set.
